#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:2
msgid "sd-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `sd-control` interface allows for the management and control of SD cards "
"on certain devices using the DualSD driver."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:7
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:9
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:9
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"The main DualSD device node (`/dev/DualSD`) is used to control certain "
"aspects of SD cards on the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/sd-control-interface.md:14
msgid "Requires snapd version _2.51.3+_."
msgstr ""

